<title>USA: Consolidated Eco-Systems names CEO.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Eco-Systems names CEO.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Eco-Systems Inc on Wednesday said it named James Connors president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Most recently, Connors was Consolidated's chief operating officer and executive vice president of sales and business development.</p>
<p>He succeeds Ed Schrader, who will continue to serve as chairman.</p>
